				Time="2011-08-05T10:06:31" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>強いわね　アナタ
わたしも　もっと　がんばらないと</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakamura_akira:W00280"
				Time="2011-08-22T12:18:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
