		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_hint_unknown_07">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あ　いたたた　……
すこしは　てかげんせんか！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakamura_akira:W00280"
				Time="2011-08-22T12:19:14" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="onoue_masayuki:W00272"
				Time="2011-08-05T10:06:31" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あ　痛たた　……
少しは　手加減せんか！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakamura_akira:W00280"
				Time="2011-08-22T12:19:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="onoue_masayuki:W00272"
				Time="2011-08-05T10:06:34" />
		</LanguageCell>
